In short, there is a limit, you're at it, and you get no more skill
slots.  Skill slots are determined only by level, level 30 is the max,
so you've got all the skill slots you'll have.

Now, if you lose levels, you lose skills.  If you then regain the lost
levels, you may get the chance to select a different skill to enhance.
 Not too sure about that however.   You'll still have the same number
of skill slots, but this just may be a way to reassign the slots. 
This seems to be born out by the following comment in weapon.c under
the lose_weapon_skill code block:

            /* It might now be possible to advance some other pending
               skill by using the refunded slots, but giving a message
               to that effect would seem pretty confusing.... */

